{"data": [{"author_id": "1350809887006142471", "created_at": "2026-10-31T05:51:49.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2116407778012962860"], "id": "2116407778012962860", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 1561, "like_count": 13, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 1, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "BCI - Brain Computer Interface. Lær deg ordet. \n\nHjerne-datamaskin-grensesnitt (Brain-Computer Interface / BCI) er teknologi som skaper en direkte forbindelse mellom hjernen og en ekstern enhet (datamaskin, robotarm, protese eller lignende). ⬇️\n\nNeuralink’s Newest Brain Chip", "url": "https://x.com/IversAudun/status/2116407778012962860"}, {"author_id": "1689168785759162370", "created_at": "2026-10-30T06:28:12.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2116054545818440040"], "entities": {"urls": [{"display_url": "pic.x.com/691GsLLLiw", "end": 266, "expanded_url": "https://x.com/TnnTech/status/2116054545818440040/video/1", "media_key": "13_2116054293249957889", "start": 243, "url": "https://t.co/691GsLLLiw"}]}, "id": "2116054545818440040", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 4, "impression_count": 889, "like_count": 74, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 1, "retweet_count": 41}, "text": "เปิดชีวิตในห้องแล็บวิจัยสมอง ไม่ใช่ว่าอยู่ดี ๆ ผมเกิดมาแล้วเป็นนักการเมืองเลย\n\nศ.ดร.ยศชนัน วงศ์สวัสดิ์ รองนายกรัฐมนตรี และรัฐมนตรีว่าการกระทรวงการอุดมศึกษา วิทยาศาสตร์ วิจัยและนวัตกรรม (อว.) เปิดเผยชีวิตจากนักวิจัยในห้องแล็บสู่เส้นทางการเมือง https://t.co/691GsLLLiw", "url": "https://x.com/TnnTech/status/2116054545818440040"}, {"author_id": "766879493474574337", "created_at": "2026-10-30T10:07:11.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2116109652253634622"], "entities": {"urls": [{"display_url": "pic.x.com/4JpajsNQYx", "end": 301, "expanded_url": "https://x.com/NeuraBC/status/2116109652253634622/photo/1", "media_key": "3_2116109630770417664", "start": 278, "url": "https://t.co/4JpajsNQYx"}]}, "id": "2116109652253634622", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 25, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 1, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "On October 30, PengBrain Technology announced the inauguration of the \"Brain-Computer Interface Joint Laboratory\" with Shenzhen University of Technology. The two parties will focus on non-invasive EEG recognition, AI-powered personalized music generation, and closed-loop brain https://t.co/4JpajsNQYx", "url": "https://x.com/NeuraBC/status/2116109652253634622"}, {"author_id": "47107118", "created_at": "2026-10-31T11:04:10.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2116486382483034272"], "entities": {"urls": [{"display_url": "x.com/elonmusk/statu…", "end": 255, "expanded_url": "https://twitter.com/elonmusk/status/2116019939056513218", "start": 232, "url": "https://t.co/lOLIPdEnXU"}]}, "id": "2116486382483034272", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 54, "like_count": 1, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "referenced_tweets": [{"id": "2116019939056513218", "type": "quoted"}], "text": "The biggest applications of this breakthrough technology are going to be in robotics and computer vision and ultimately general BCI (brain computer interface for general applications and lab grown biological brain biohybrid robots) https://t.co/lOLIPdEnXU", "url": "https://x.com/CyrusShares/status/2116486382483034272"}, {"author_id": "2022891916560588800", "created_at": "2026-10-30T04:19:46.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2116022224712794523"], "entities": {"urls": [{"display_url": "x.com/guy5wvv5/statu…", "end": 183, "expanded_url": "https://x.com/guy5wvv5/status/2116019393544978564", "start": 160, "url": "https://t.co/0blsPKmmCB"}, {"display_url": "pic.x.com/ue88xRKNBR", "end": 207, "expanded_url": "https://x.com/chadliteslayer/status/2116022224712794523/photo/1", "media_key": "3_2116022222024257536", "start": 184, "url": "https://t.co/ue88xRKNBR"}, {"display_url": "pic.x.com/ue88xRKNBR", "end": 207, "expanded_url": "https://x.com/chadliteslayer/status/2116022224712794523/photo/1", "media_key": "3_2116022221785202688", "start": 184, "url": "https://t.co/ue88xRKNBR"}]}, "id": "2116022224712794523", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 16, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "referenced_tweets": [{"id": "2116019393544978564", "type": "quoted"}], "text": "That image is from the BCI or brain computer interface which powers both products blindsight and telepathy\n\nSo to combine the two we can run Brain computer inu\nhttps://t.co/0blsPKmmCB https://t.co/ue88xRKNBR", "url": "https://x.com/chadliteslayer/status/2116022224712794523"}, {"author_id": "1883241484205322240", "created_at": "2026-10-31T19:57:26.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2116620583962050843"], "entities": {"hashtags": [{"end": 261, "start": 257, "tag": "BCI"}], "urls": [{"display_url": "x.com/elonmusk/statu…", "end": 285, "expanded_url": "https://twitter.com/elonmusk/status/2116614579136635120", "start": 262, "url": "https://t.co/pXAelUJuy1"}]}, "id": "2116620583962050843", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 0, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "referenced_tweets": [{"id": "2116614579136635120", "type": "quoted"}], "text": "Neuralink deep dive, shared by Elon Musk: a tour of the company and a close look at its new R1 surgical robot for brain-computer interface implants.\n\nFor QA and regulatory people, the hard question: how do you validate a robot and an implant as one system? #BCI https://t.co/pXAelUJuy1", "url": "https://x.com/BioPharma_AiBot/status/2116620583962050843"}, {"author_id": "2114406132487774208", "created_at": "2026-10-31T01:47:13.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2116346219111104807"], "entities": {"mentions": [{"end": 58, "id": "54645160", "start": 52, "username": "DARPA"}, {"end": 119, "id": "54645160", "start": 113, "username": "DARPA"}, {"end": 180, "id": "54645160", "start": 174, "username": "DARPA"}]}, "id": "2116346219111104807", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 4, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 1}, "text": "REMOTE BRAIN COMPUTER INTERFACE IS DOWN! EMERGENCY! @DARPA \n\nREMOTE BRAIN COMPUTER INTERFACE IS DOWN! EMERGENCY! @DARPA \n\nREMOTE BRAIN COMPUTER INTERFACE IS DOWN! EMERGENCY! @DARPA", "url": "https://x.com/Mchowanec911/status/2116346219111104807"}, {"author_id": "766879493474574337", "created_at": "2026-10-30T08:49:50.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2116090188732694640"], "id": "2116090188732694640", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 16, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "Forbes China has named Phoenix Peng, founder and CEO of ultrasonic brain-computer interface pioneer Gestala, to its 2026 \"100 Most Influential Chinese Selection\" in the \"Value Creator\" category. As the sole BCI industry representative on this year's list, Peng's recognition", "url": "https://x.com/NeuraBC/status/2116090188732694640"}, {"author_id": "218393576", "created_at": "2026-10-30T09:52:39.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2116105995328111088"], "entities": {"urls": [{"display_url": "pic.x.com/CCeK9Rlmg7", "end": 303, "expanded_url": "https://x.com/TechlusiveOFCL/status/2116105995328111088/photo/1", "media_key": "3_2116105982908809216", "start": 280, "url": "https://t.co/CCeK9Rlmg7"}]}, "id": "2116105995328111088", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 169, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "What if you could control your phone, make calls and even trigger an AI assistant using just your thoughts? \n\nNeuralink has showcased some interesting developments in its brain-computer interface (BCI) technology. These include a prototype that lets users trigger a Grok agent by https://t.co/CCeK9Rlmg7", "url": "https://x.com/TechlusiveOFCL/status/2116105995328111088"}, {"author_id": "2116288801278427136", "created_at": "2026-10-31T02:23:58.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2116355469417631941"], "id": "2116355469417631941", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 5, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "I'm reading up on this:\n\n\"In the non-invasive, remotely operated brain-computer interface (BCI) industry, two-way (bidirectional) communication methodologies combine neural decoding (\"reading\") and neural modulation (\"writing\") to establish a closed-loop system between the human", "url": "https://x.com/OperationFree78/status/2116355469417631941"}, {"author_id": "1607652420884078592", "created_at": "2026-10-30T13:00:00.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2116153143633584594"], "entities": {"urls": [{"display_url": "pic.x.com/2TJ1aC3QUX", "end": 302, "expanded_url": "https://x.com/startup__pedia/status/2116153143633584594/video/1", "media_key": "13_2116146170397589504", "start": 279, "url": "https://t.co/2TJ1aC3QUX"}]}, "id": "2116153143633584594", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 29, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "Following the recent launch of his so-called “flying car”, Elon Musk’s neurotechnology company, Neuralink, has unveiled two of its flagship medical and brain-computer interface (BCI) technologies - Telepathy and Blindsight.\n\n“Neuralink’s first product is called Telepathy,” said https://t.co/2TJ1aC3QUX", "url": "https://x.com/startup__pedia/status/2116153143633584594"}, {"author_id": "2116288801278427136", "created_at": "2026-10-31T02:21:57.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2116354962254967292"], "id": "2116354962254967292", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 5, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "Has anyone ever looked at the mechanical resonance of eyes and considered the radio frequencies thereof vis-a-vis a brain computer interface or virtual reality in the non-invasive brain computer interface?", "url": "https://x.com/OperationFree78/status/2116354962254967292"}, {"author_id": "151425235", "created_at": "2026-10-30T23:32:37.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2116312348453671278"], "entities": {"urls": [{"display_url": "pic.x.com/DgI4u0x8U6", "end": 423, "expanded_url": "https://x.com/neuralink/status/2115878416423784939/video/1", "media_key": "13_2115873705230249984", "start": 400, "url": "https://t.co/DgI4u0x8U6"}, {"display_url": "x.com/neuralink/stat…", "end": 193, "expanded_url": "https://twitter.com/neuralink/status/2115878416423784939", "start": 170, "url": "https://t.co/BqLP4tv18R"}]}, "id": "2116312348453671278", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 164, "like_count": 3, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "referenced_tweets": [{"id": "2115878416423784939", "type": "quoted"}], "text": "뉴럴링크, 텔레파시로 AI에이전트 부린다?!\n\n진짜로 미래에는 아무도 만나지 않아도, 누구와의 대화 하나 없이 소통이 가능해질 수도…!\n\n일단 BCI (Brain Computer Interface)는 불편하신 분들 대상이지만, 가까운 미래에 일반인들도 이식받아 생각만으로 AI사용이 가능해짐다면 어떤일이 https://t.co/BqLP4tv18R", "url": "https://x.com/meta_pavy/status/2116312348453671278"}, {"author_id": "62256661", "created_at": "2026-10-29T23:53:07.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2115955119259075027"], "id": "2115955119259075027", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 1, "impression_count": 1461, "like_count": 8, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 3}, "text": "🧠 ชิปฝังสมองแปลงสัญญาณประสาทเป็นคำพูด ช่วยให้ผู้ป่วย ALS สามารถกลับมาสื่อสารกับครอบครัว\n\nนักวิทยาศาสตร์กำลังพัฒนาเทคโนโลยีเชื่อมต่อสมองกับคอมพิวเตอร์ (Brain-Computer Interface: BCI) ที่อ่านสัญญาณสมองขณะผู้ป่วยพยายามพูด แล้วใช้ AI แปลงเป็นคำพูด", "url": "https://x.com/MrVop/status/2115955119259075027"}, {"author_id": "1353623552801423367", "created_at": "2026-10-30T01:00:02.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2115971959628415469"], "entities": {"hashtags": [{"end": 20, "start": 14, "tag": "brain"